{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"有限单群分类"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"有限单群分类"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>陈述</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>素数阶循环群</li>\n<li>$A_n$, $n\\geq 5$</li>\n<li>"},{"Local":{"url":"FSLT","text":"Lie 型有限单群"}},{"Plain":" $A_n(q)$, $B_n(q)$, $C_n(q)$, $D_n(q)$, $G_2(q)$, $F_4(q)$, $E_6(q)$, $E_7(q)$, $E_8(q)$, 其中 $q=p^n$ 为素数幂</li>\n<li>${^2A}_n(q^2)$, ${^2A}_n(q^2)$,</li>\n<li>…</li>\n</ul>\n"}]}}